 "summary": "Page-description and document file format: a graph of typed objects (dictionaries, arrays, streams, indirect references) located through a cross-reference table, whose page content streams are a PostScript-derived postfix operator language for text, paths and images; the language also covers fonts, annotations, forms, structure tagging and encryption.",
 "status": "active",
