 "level_notes": {
  "1": "ISO 32000-2 (PDF 2.0) is sold by ISO but available at no cost via the PDF Association (registration). Adobe hosts a free copy of ISO 32000-1:2008 (PDF 1.7); its sections are deep-linked by PDF page number. pdfa.org pages report 403 to automated clients.",
